/******************************************************************************
 * File:
 * ChartWindow.tsx
 *
 * Path:
 * src/components/ChartWindow.tsx.current1609
 *
 * Purpose:
 * Primary orchestration component for a single trading chart in AJ v2.
 *
 * ChartWindow owns the complete lifecycle of a chart instance including
 * data acquisition, runtime context construction, execution of the AJ
 * institutional pipeline, chart rendering, dashboard integration,
 * indicator configuration, and chart-specific state management.
 *
 * It serves as the bridge between the React UI layer and the AJ
 * institutional trading engine.
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 *
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * • Create and maintain a unique chart instance
 * • Manage chart lifecycle
 * • Load historical market data
 * • Subscribe to live market data
 * • Build the RuntimeContext
 * • Execute RuntimeEngine
 * • Execute AJHost
 * • Feed ChartEngine
 * • Manage indicator settings
 * • Coordinate dashboard updates
 * • Maintain active chart state
 * • Handle datasource authentication
 * • Manage chart UI components
 *
 * This component DOES NOT:
 *
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * • Calculate technical indicators
 * • Detect trends
 * • Detect market structure
 * • Detect liquidity
 * • Execute trading algorithms
 * • Calculate confidence
 * • Calculate authority
 * • Perform Smart Money analysis
 * • Manage runtime thresholds
 * • Execute institutional engines
 *
 * Those responsibilities belong to RuntimeEngine,
 * AJHost and the AJ Decision Pipeline.
 *                    AI-Institutional
 *                          │
 *                   ┌──────▼──────┐
 *                   │ Workspace8  │
 *                   └──────┬──────┘
 *                          │
 *                   ┌──────▼──────┐
 *                   │ ChartWindow │
 *                   └──────┬──────┘
 *                          │
 *         ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
 *         │                │                │
 *      Feed/Data        Indicators       Chart UI
 *         │                │                │
 *         └────────────────┼────────────────┘
