 *                   ┌──────▼──────┐
 *                   │ ChartEngine │
 *                   └──────┬──────┘
 *                          │
 *                 Lightweight Charts
 *                          │
 *             ┌────────────┼────────────┐
 *             │            │            │
 *          Candles      Overlays     Markers
 *             │            │            │
 *             └────────────┼────────────┘
 *                          │
 *                   Trading Terminal
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * AJ v2 Chart Architecture
 *
 * User
 *      │
 *      ▼
 *
 * ChartWindow
 * (Chart Orchestrator)
 *
 *      │
 *      ├──────── Symbol Selection
 *      ├──────── Timeframe Selection
 *      ├──────── Data Source Selection
 *      ├──────── Indicator Settings
 *      ├──────── Dashboard
