 * Subscribe live feed
 *
 *      │
 *      ▼
 *
 * Build RuntimeContext
 *
 *      │
 *      ▼
 *
 * Execute RuntimeEngine
 *
 *      │
 *      ▼
 *
 * Execute AJHost
 *
 *      │
 *      ▼
 *
 * Update Dashboard
 *
 *      │
 *      ▼
