 *
 * Render ChartEngine
 *
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * Internal Modules Coordinated
 *
 * • ActiveChartStore
 * • RuntimeEngine
 * • AJHost
 * • ChartEngine
 * • DebugEngine
 * • AJDashboardAdapter
