 * • Debug updates
 * • Chart rendering
 * • Indicator settings state
 *
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * Design Goals
 *
 * • Single owner of chart lifecycle
 * • One RuntimeContext per chart
 * • One RuntimeEngine per chart
 * • One AJHost execution per update
 * • React orchestrator only
 * • No trading logic
 * • Clean separation of UI and engines
 * • Extensible for multiple data providers
