 * • Stable integration point for AJ v2
 *
 * ChartWindow is intentionally the orchestration layer.
 * All institutional trading intelligence resides inside
 * RuntimeEngine, AJHost, AJDecisionEngine and the
 * specialized AJ engines. Its responsibility is to
 * coordinate the flow of market data through the system
 * and present the resulting outputs to the user interface.
 ******************************************************************************/

